<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND V SRI LANKA MATCH TIED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND V SRI LANKA MATCH TIED.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The match between New Zealand and Sri Lanka ended in a tie in the Singer Champions Trophy cricket tournament on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 169 for 8 in 50 overs; Sri Lanka 169 all out in 48 overs.</p>
</text>
